<title>USA: Mitsubishi June US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi June US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
